# Image-baked config defaults — NON-SECRET values only (this file is committed).
#
# The Dockerfile copies this to /app/.env. Every .env loader in the app is
# setdefault-style (real env wins), so a Railway service variable with the same
# name always overrides the value here; delete the Railway variable to fall back
# to this default. Secrets (API keys, tokens) stay in Railway variables.
#
# Local dev does NOT read this file — use your own .env (see .env.example).

# News-trigger research model. Unset, it falls through CLAUDE_MODEL to the Opus
# client default (2x Sonnet pricing) — the 2026-09 run burned Opus rates this way.
NEWS_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
